  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "簡單ê幸福"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><b style=\"font-size: large;\">作者：</b><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b>Ngôo Juē-ínn</b></span></p><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">啥mi̍h是簡單ê幸福，對21世紀ê你認為是啥neh？對內心iáu是真傳統ê我來講，一家伙仔ē-tàng做伙就是一種簡單ê幸福。是按怎講neh？自細漢爸母開店做生理，就kā阮兄弟姊妹仔tshuā tī身軀邊照顧，寸步不離，喜、怒、哀、樂lóng做伙。阿爸、阿母mā lóng ē陪阮tshit-thô、行棋，教阮做人做事ê道理，凡事ài替別人設想，mā ài tàu-sann-kāng弱勢ê人。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Ē記--得，細漢蹛ê所在，有一工阿爸leh做生理，有一个阿婆ê三輪車歹--去，iáu-koh拄著tsiūnn崎ê路段，無人去kā阿婆tàu-sann-kāng。伊是一个é-káu，kan-na ē用真粗ê聲音來huah-hiu kah用比--ê，所以無人敢去幫助阿婆，但是我ê阿爸kah阿母suah去kā tàu-sann-kāng渡過難關——hit時hōo我感覺我ê阿爸、阿母真善良、真偉大，我mā感覺我真正幸運kah幸福。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Tsit-má我已經大漢，mā嫁--人--ah，有家己ê家庭，翁婿真體貼，對序大mā真尊重，囡仔mā真bat代誌。雖bóng有tang時仔mā ē有意見bē ha̍h ê時tsūn，但是最後lóng ē講好勢、互相來理解，規家伙仔有講有笑。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">人leh講「無所求」就是一種上好ê幸福，所以對我來講，我認為一家伙仔ē-tàng蹛做伙是一種簡單ê幸福，不管蹛--ê是樓仔厝，iah是破厝仔、食好食bái，厝內總是té滿滿滿ê記持kah幸福。Tse是我簡單ê幸福，mā祝你揣著你ê幸福őo！</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh6KShxZI5AF0sdSgvKBPBMLbt16bBFphgUEn1g-tPq0RvtyBgF7_49N_bl-GoE-PHDRc3tecH6sknKBc1tn5FZ7E5coxB7iOX5lf3sX-RD_OuF4t0B5o0Z0sVxqc3gO0YePDfnaWOdklH1l4KbkWaATDbz0UilY5vu1UotJSUkNYItQcCJgaxr_zQyRA/s1424/336%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh6KShxZI5AF0sdSgvKBPBMLbt16bBFphgUEn1g-tPq0RvtyBgF7_49N_bl-GoE-PHDRc3tecH6sknKBc1tn5FZ7E5coxB7iOX5lf3sX-RD_OuF4t0B5o0Z0sVxqc3gO0YePDfnaWOdklH1l4KbkWaATDbz0UilY5vu1UotJSUkNYItQcCJgaxr_zQyRA/w450-h640/336%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiuHdB0kZQQZBbSiP14TyB_74NU6bcgg_Z7qtFj6nxPkJZ538Dj8oeO0-9ZhfVoTFa7vOcP7bPCcYPV99E7Zj8KY3qD-DJyleRsH4a86_tAWH8f3nrtxCsq3u3J5ixCdQO6dp-8lO1p6EnktkRSQbilPDS2UiU1Lkt8TJatqNFuF5WD1F3mBNMI7xK5gg/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1336%E6%9C%9F_09.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiuHdB0kZQQZBbSiP14TyB_74NU6bcgg_Z7qtFj6nxPkJZ538Dj8oeO0-9ZhfVoTFa7vOcP7bPCcYPV99E7Zj8KY3qD-DJyleRsH4a86_tAWH8f3nrtxCsq3u3J5ixCdQO6dp-8lO1p6EnktkRSQbilPDS2UiU1Lkt8TJatqNFuF5WD1F3mBNMI7xK5gg/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1336%E6%9C%9F_09.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><div><br /></div><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div><span><b>#逐家來phò-tāu&nbsp;</b><b style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span>專欄，</span><span>本文使用教育部推薦漢字kap臺灣閩南語羅馬字拼音方案。<br /><br /></span></b></span></div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: inherit; text-align: